认清朝宗主权。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.黑田清隆"}],"tags":["日本","朝鲜"],"relations":[{"type":"participant","target":"event.1876.汉城"}]},{"id":"person.xu-jingcheng","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"许景澄","en":"Xu Jingcheng"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"许竹篔"},{"zh-Hans":"竹筠"},{"zh-Hans":"竹筼"},{"zh-Hans":"许癸身"},{"zh-Hans":"竹耘"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1845","end":"1900","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"嘉兴"},"coord":[120.76,30.75]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"浙江嘉兴人，字竹篔。同治七年进士；1884 年起出使法、德、奥、荷、俄等国，1896 年任中东铁路公司督办，主持东清铁路的勘线、设站与对俄交涉——1898 年哈尔滨设枢纽站即在其任内。1900 年因反对围攻使馆被处死。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.许景澄"}],"tags":["外交","铁路"],"relations":[{"type":"participant","target":"event.1898.哈尔滨"},{"type":"participant","target":"event.1892.帕米尔"}]},{"id":"person.tait","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"德滴","en":"James Tait"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"德滴"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1846","end":"1860","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"厦门"},"coord":[118.08,24.48]}]},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"英国商人。1846 年搭乘西班牙货船到厦门，以受西班牙政府委托建领事馆为名取得租房，开办德记洋行，后专营苦力贸易，人称「大德记卖人行」。生卒年不详，此处取其活动可考区间。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.《近代契约华工法律研究》"}],"tags":["厦门","苦力贸易"],"relations":[{"type":"participant","target":"event.1847.厦门"}]},{"id":"person.richard","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"李提摩太","en":"Timothy Richard"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1845","end":"1919","precision":"year"},"nationality":"uk","summary":{"zh-Hans":"英浸礼会传教士，办《万国公报》、广学会，与维新派交往甚密。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.《近代来华外国人名辞典》"}],"tags":["外国人","英国","传教士"],"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"北京"},"coord":[116.4,39.9]}]},"relations":[{"type":"member_of","target":"group.chuanjiaoshi"},{"type":"custom:director_of","target":"institution.广学会"}]},{"id":"person.ito","type":"person","labels":{"zh-Hans":"伊藤博文","en":"Itō Hirobumi"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1841","end":"1909","precision":"year"},"nationality":"jp","summary":{"zh-Hans":"日本首任内阁总理大臣，甲午战争后任全权代表签署《马关条约》，1909 年在哈尔滨遇刺。"},"s